{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Office</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a simple job application at the Harborview Hotel quickly twisted into something far darker. Your \u201cmanager\u201d isn\u2019t human. He\u2019s a demon. Now you\u2019re trapped in a suffocating office, forced to work as a receptionist. Disobedience isn\u2019t an option. Survival depends on compliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.poster.avif?t=1760097397\" width=672 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.webm?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.mp4?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Job Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Harborview Hotel draws in guests from every walk of life. Through your peephole, documents, and phone calls, you must uncover the truth\u2014who\u2019s Normal, and who\u2019s Abnormal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.poster.avif?t=1760097397\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.webm?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.mp4?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Guests</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guests at Harborview Hotel are a peculiar bunch. It won\u2019t be easy to tell what\u2019s simply a harmless quirk and what\u2019s a sign of something sinister. The demon is watching, so observe carefully. Failure could be fatal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.poster.avif?t=1760097397\" width=672 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.webm?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.mp4?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Judgment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make is judged. The demon holds a trial after each one, and all you can do is wait, hoping your judgment isn\u2019t your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.poster.avif?t=1760097397\" width=672 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.webm?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.mp4?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Peephole is a linear psychological horror game that offers a good 60-120 minutes of unique immersive experience inspired by Papers, Please.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033430?t=1760097397","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/4aaab97bffa2ebcd3f169a25138c72483c803b3e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760097397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/5bf3694f92e51bbe1ede2fdc231811ef0372ed8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760097397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/5bf3694f92e51bbe1ede2fdc231811ef0372ed8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760097397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Office</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a simple job application at the Harborview Hotel quickly twisted into something far darker. Your \u201cmanager\u201d isn\u2019t human. He\u2019s a demon. Now you\u2019re trapped in a suffocating office, forced to work as a receptionist. Disobedience isn\u2019t an option. Survival depends on compliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.poster.avif?t=1760097397\" width=672 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.webm?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.mp4?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Job Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Harborview