 judgment isn\u2019t your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.poster.avif?t=1760097397\" width=672 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.webm?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.mp4?t=1760097397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Peephole is a linear psychological horror game that offers a good 60-120 minutes of unique immersive experience inspired by Papers, Please.</p>","developers":["Limeless Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/37b2d2f6d6c4c8b804e45984ea7f14156c228814/header.jpg?t=1760097397","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033430/380373186/06fd205fb2cabe0d225907cb9611c47127d03cc2/1759899021/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759901891","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033430/380373186/06fd205fb2cabe0d225907cb9611c47127d03cc2/1759899021/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759901891","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033430/380373186/06fd205fb2cabe0d225907cb9611c47127d03cc2/1759899021/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759901891","id":257214081,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214081/movie480.mp4?t=1759901891","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214081/movie_max.mp4?t=1759901891"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic